  "text": "Each month, there will be a new movie at the movie theater. You can invite a Party Member to watch a movie which will raise their level by one, and also increase three extra stats. Since Rise can't fight, she doesn't get the extra stats. If the movie is the Party Member's favorite, then they gain points toward their Social Link. Each Party Member can only watch each movie once. If the current dungeon hasn't been cleared, then Party Members will decline an invite to the movies. Here is the list of each movie and all relevant details.\nMovie List\nMovie | Month | Stat Increase | Favorite\nLoan of the Rings | June | MA, EN, AG | N/A\nDumminator II | July | ST, EN, AG | Yosuke\nTrial of the Dragon | August | ST, AG, LU | Chie\nOne Missed Text | September | ST, MA, EN | Yukiko\nDachiko Story | October | EN, AG, LU | Kanji\nRoman Paid Holiday | November | MA, AG, LU | Rise\nObatar | January | ST, EN, LU | N/A\nOrso Rosso | February | ST, MA, AG | Teddie\nStat List\nThis is the list of stats each Party Member will earn if you watch every movie with them.\nYosuke Hanamura:\nST +5\nMA +4\nEN +5\nAG +6\nLU +4\nChie Satonaka:\nST +5\nMA +4\nEN +5\nAG +6\nLU +4\nYukiko Amagi:\nST +5\nMA +4\nEN +5\nAG +6\nLU +4\nKanji Tatsumi:\nST +5\nMA +4\nEN +5\nAG +6\nLU +4\nRise Kujikawa: N/A\nTeddie:\nST +5\nMA +3\nEN +4\nAG +5\nLU +4\nNaoto Shirogane:\nST +2\nMA +2\nEN +2\nAG +3\nLU +3"
